WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:03.940
Welcome to the Federal Modernization
Workbook's developer workbook,

2
00:00:03.940 --> 00:00:06.287
Building the Attribute-Driven Migration.

3
00:00:06.287 --> 00:00:10.162
This is Chapter 2: Graph clients
for the government clouds.

4
00:00:10.162 --> 00:00:15.558
Every piece of code in this workbook that
calls Microsoft Graph should follow one

5
00:00:15.558 --> 00:00:20.717
pattern: know which cloud it's in, send its
token nowhere else, ask for no more than

6
00:00:20.717 --> 00:00:25.875
each call needs, and keep working when
Graph says slow down or a beta API changes.

7
00:00:25.875 --> 00:00:30.347
We'll sort out which cloud is which,
run Microsoft's own snippets to see

8
00:00:30.347 --> 00:00:34.975
what they leave out, walk the client's
rules, then two labs and the dangers.

9
00:00:34.975 --> 00:00:40.180
One note before we begin: the code is
illustrative, tested against fixtures.
